program	errors/ref_sigil_missing_var.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	parameter `y` is `&var Int`; write `&var b`
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: parameter `y` is `&var Int`; write `&var b`"
log	"  --> examples/errors/ref_sigil_missing_var.saw:12:10"
log	"     |"
log	" 12 |     bump(&b)"
log	"     |          ^"
log	"   hint: call sites mirror the parameter's reference spelling"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
